column2:
May the ancestors be gentle; may our lineage always grow; may our givers flourish; the Vedas and progeny;
agnipuran:117:26	may faith not leave us; may we have much to give; may our food be abundant and may we obtain guests;
agnipuran:117:27	may we have petitioners and may we not ask anyone. Having spread kusha with sacred threads to be spoken over with svadha,
